      "solution": "<p>Logic: </p><p>1st number × 2 + 3rd number × 3 = 2nd number</p><p>(7, 80, 22)</p><p>7 × 2 + 22 × 3 = 14 + 66 = 80 </p><p>(43, 143, 19)</p><p>43 × 2 + 19 × 3 = 86 + 57 = 143</p><p>Option(c),</p><p>(13, 89, 21)</p><p>13 × 2 + 21 × 3 = 26 + 63 = 89</p>",
