      "solution": "<p>Logic:</p><p>√(1st number + 2nd number) = 3rd number</p><p>(15, −6, 3)</p><p>15 + (−6) = 9</p><p>√9 = 3 </p><p>(43, 582, 25)</p><p>43 + 582 = 625</p><p>√625 = 25 </p><p>From option (d),</p><p>(45, 99, 12)</p><p>45 + 99 = 144</p><p>√144 = 12 </p>",
